                            <comment id="12861307" author="srowen" created="Tue, 27 Apr 2010 08:25:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Yeah looks like the old mechanism was left in and it should not have been. I just removed the code in the reducer. You can try again from SVN.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
